e made them leaders guiding by Our command. And We inspired to them the doing of good deeds, establishment of prayer, and giving of zakāh; and they were worshippers of Us.","j":17,"h":33,"s":21,"a":73,"sd":null},{"k":"21:74","t":"And to Lot We gave judgement and knowledge, and We saved him from the city that was committing wicked deeds. Indeed, they were a people of evil, defiantly disobedient.","j":17,"h":33,"s":21,"a":74,"sd":null},{"k":"21:75","t":"And We admitted him into Our mercy. Indeed, he was of the righteous.","j":17,"h":33,"s":21,"a":75,"sd":null},{"k":"21:76","t":"And [mention] Noah, when he called [to Allāh] before [that time], so We responded to him and saved him and his family from the great affliction [i.e., the flood].","j":17,"h":33,"s":21,"a":76,"sd":null},{"k":"21:77","t":"And We aided [i.e., saved] him from the people who denied Our signs. Indeed, they were a people of evil, so We drowned them, all together.","j":17,"h":33,"s":21,"a":77,"sd":null},{"k":"21:78","t":"And [mention] David and Solomon, when they judged concerning the field - when the sheep of a people overran it [at night], and We were witness to their judgement.","j":17,"h":33,"s":21,"a":78,"sd":null},{"k":"21:79","t":"And We gave understanding of it [i.e., the case] to Solomon, and to each [of them] We gave judgement and knowledge. And We subjected the mountains to exalt [Us], along with David and [also] the birds. And We were doing [that].","j":17,"h":33,"s":21,"a":79,"sd":null},{"k":"21:80","t":"And We taught him the fashioning of coats of armor to protect you from your [enemy in] battle. So will you then be grateful?","j":17,"h":33,"s":21,"a":80,"sd":null},{"k":"21:81","t":"And to Solomon [We subjected] the wind, blowing forcefully, proceeding by his command toward the land which We had blessed. And We are ever, of all things, Knowing.","j":17,"h":33,"s":21,"a":81,"sd":null}],"juz":17,"hizb":33,"surahs":[21],"sajdah":false}